u\"/><meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Platform AI Gratis untuk Bantu Belajar Siswa Indonesia\"/><meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://tugasmu.com\"/><meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"TugasMu\"/><meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"id_ID\"/><meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"website\"/><meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary\"/><meta name=\"twitter:title\" content=\"TugasMu | AI yang ngerti pelajaran kamu\"/><meta name=\"twitter:description\" content=\"Platform AI Gratis untuk Bantu Belajar Siswa Indonesia\"/><link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/favicon.ico\" type=\"image/x-icon\" sizes=\"16x16\"/><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/polyfills-42372ed130431b0a.js\" noModule=\"\"></script></head><body class=\"font-sans bg-brand-cream text-brand-navy flex flex-col min-h-screen __variable_0d7163 __variable_5667dc\"><header class=\"sticky top-0 z-50 w-full\"><div class=\"bg-brand-cream/95 backdrop-blur-md border-b border-brand-navy/10\"><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 h-16 flex items-center justify-between\"><a class=\"flex items-center gap-2.5 group\" href=\"/\"><div class=\"w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-brand-navy flex items-center justify-center shadow-sm group-hover:bg-brand-lime transition-colors duration-300\"><svg class=\"w-4 h-4 fill-brand-cream group-hover:fill-brand-navy transition-colors duration-300\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><polygon points=\"13 2 3 14 12 14 11 22 21 10 12 10 13 2\"></polygon></svg></div><span class=\"font-heading font-bold text-xl text-brand-navy tracking-tight group-hover:text-brand-navy/70 transition-colors\">TugasMu</span></a><nav class=\"hidden md:flex items-center gap-1\"><a class=\"relative px-4 py-2 text-sm font-semibold rounded-full transition-all duration-200 text-brand-navy bg-brand-lime\" href=\"/tools\">AI Tools</a><a class=\"relative px-4 py-2 text-sm font-semibold rounded-full transition-all duration-200 text-brand-navy/70 hover:text-brand-navy hover:bg-brand-navy/5\" href=\"/harga\">Premium</a><a class=\"relative px-4 py-2 text-sm font-semibold rounded-full transition-all duration-200 text-brand-navy/70 hover:text-brand-navy hover:bg-brand-navy/5\" href=\"/blog\">Blog</a></nav><div class=\"hidden md:flex items-center gap-3\"><a class=\"px-5 py-2.5 rounded-full bg-brand-navy hover:bg-brand-navy/90 text-brand-cream font-bold text-sm transition-all shadow-sm hover:shadow-md active:scale-95 flex items-center gap-2\" href=\"/masuk\">Masuk / Daftar</a></div><div class=\"flex md:hidden items-center gap-3\"><button class=\"p-2 rounded-full text-brand-navy hover:bg-brand-navy/5 transition-colors\" aria-label=\"Toggle Menu\"><svg class=\"w-5 h-5\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"><line x1=\"3\" y1=\"8\" x2=\"21\" y2=\"8\"></line><line x1=\"3\" y1=\"16\" x2=\"21\" y2=\"16\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></header><div class=\"bg-slate-50 border-b\"><div class=\"container py-3\"><nav class=\"flex text-sm text-slate-500\" aria-label=\"Breadcrumb\"><ol class=\"inline-flex items-center space-x-1 md:space-x-3\"><li class=\"inline-flex items-center\"><a class=\"hover:text-slate-900 transition-colors\" href=\"/\">Home</a></li><li><div class=\"flex items-center\"><span class=\"mx-2 text-slate-400\">/</span><a class=\"hover:text-slate-900 transition-colors\" href=\"/tools\">Tools</a></div></li><li><div class=\"flex items-center\"><span class=\"mx-2 text-slate-400\">/</span><span class=\"text-slate-900 font-medium\" aria-current=\"page\">Nahwu shorof</span></div></li></ol></nav></div></div><main class=\"flex-1\"><div class=\"container py-8 md:py-12 max-w-5xl\"><div class=\"mb-8 max-w-3xl\"><h1 class=\"text-3xl md:text-4xl font-heading font-bold text-slate-900 mb-4\">Bedah I&#x27;rab &amp; Tata Bahasa Arab (Nahwu Shorof)</h1><p class=\"text-slate-600 text-lg\">Bingung menentukan Fa&#x27;il, Maf&#x27;ul, atau Mubtada Khabar? Ketik kalimatnya, biar AI yang menjabarkan I&#x27;rab-nya.</p></div><form class=\"space-y-6\"><div class=\"space-y-4\"><div class=\"space-y-2\"><label class=\"block font-label-md text-label-md text-on-surface\">Kalimat Arab yang Ingin Di-I&#x27;rab</label><input type=\"text\" placeholder=\"Contoh: ضرب زيد كلبا\" class=\"w-full px-3.5 py-3 rounded-xl bg-surface-container-low text-on-surface font-body-md text-body-md focus:bg-surface-container-lowest focus:ring-2 focus:ring-primary-container outline-none transition-all disabled:opacity-50\" value=\"\"/></div></div><button type=\"submit\" class=\"w-full h-12 rounded-xl bg-primary-container hover:bg-primary text-on-primary font-label-lg text-label-lg transition-all shadow-sm disabled:opacity-60 disabled:cursor-not-allowed flex items-center justify-center gap-2\"><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-[20px]\">account_tree</span><span>Generate Hasil</span></button></form><div class=\"mt-16 bg-white rounded-3xl p-8 border border-slate-200 shadow-sm\"><div class=\"prose prose-slate max-w-none prose-headings:font-heading prose-a:text-sky-600\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-4 flex items-center gap-2\"><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-sky-500 text-[32px]\">account_tree</span>Mengapa Belajar Nahwu Shorof Itu Penting?</h2><p>Di pesantren ada pepatah: <em>Shorof adalah ibunya ilmu, dan Nahwu adalah bapaknya</em>. Tanpa keduanya, seseorang tidak akan bisa menggali hukum dari Al-Quran dan Hadits dengan benar.</p><p>Tool ini berfungsi sebagai asisten saat kamu kebingungan menentukan harakat akhir kalimat (I&#x27;rab) atau mencari asal kata (Wazan) saat setoran hafalan Alfiyah Ibnu Malik atau Jurumiyah.</p></div></div><div class=\"mt-12\"><section class=\"mt-space-xl pt-space-lg flex flex-col gap-space-md\"><div class=\"mb-2\"><h2 class=\"font-headline-md text-headline-md text-on-surface flex items-center gap-2\"><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-primary text-[24px]\">help</span>Pertanyaan Seputar Tool Ini</h2><p class=\"font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant mt-1 max-w-3xl\">Panduan singkat penggunaan.</p></div><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-3\"><details class=\"group bg-surface-container-lowest rounded-xl shadow-sm border border-outline-variant/30 overflow-hidden [&amp;_summary::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden\"><summary class=\"flex items-center justify-between p-4 md:p-5 cursor-pointer list-none hover:bg-surface-container-low transition-colors outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-primary-container\"><h3 class=\"font-label-lg text-label-lg md:text-headline-sm md:font-headline-sm text-on-surface font-semibold pr-4\">Apakah format i&#x27;rabnya standar kitab kuning?</h3><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-on-surface-variant group-open:-rotate-180 transition-transform duration-300 shrink-0\">keyboard_arrow_down</span></summary><div class=\"p-4 md:p-5 pt-0 border-t border-outline-variant/20 font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed bg-surface-container-lowest animate-in fade-in slide-in-from-top-2 duration-300\"><div class=\"prose prose-sm md:prose-base prose-slate max-w-none prose-p:mb-3 prose-p:last:mb-0\"><div><p>Ya, penjelasan I'rab akan menyebutkan istilah baku seperti <em>Marfu' wa 'alamat raf'ihi dhommah dzohirah</em> dan sebagainya, lalu dijelaskan dalam bahasa Indonesia.</p></div></div></div></details></div></section></div></div></main><footer class=\"bg-slate-50 border-t border-slate-200 py-10 mt-auto\"><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8\"><div class=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-6\"><div class=\"flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center gap-3 sm:gap-6 text-center sm:text-left\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><div class=\"w-7 h-7 rounded-lg bg-sky-500 flex items-center justify-center text-white\"><svg class=\"w-3.5 h-3.5 fill-white\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><polygon points=\"13 2 3 14 12 14 11 22 21 10 12 10 13 2\"></polygon></svg></div><span class=\"font-bold text-slate-900 text-base font-heading\">TugasMu.com</span></div><span class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-500\">© 2026 TugasMu.com. Hak cipta dilindungi.</span></div><div class=\"flex flex-wrap justify-center items-center gap-x-6 gap-y-3 text-xs sm:text-sm font-medium text-slate-500\"><a class=\"hover:text-slate-900 transition-colors\" href=\"/\">Beranda</a><a class=\"hover:text-slate-900 transition-colors\" href=\"/harga\">Premium</a><a class=\"hover:text-slate-900 transition-colors\" href=\"/blog\">Blog</a><a class=\"hover:text-slate-900 transition-colors\" href=\"/privasi\">Privacy Policy</a><a class=\"hover:text-slate-900 transition-colors\" href=\"/syarat\">Terms of Service</a><a class=\"hover:text-slate-900 transition-colors\" href=\"/kontak\">Kontak</a></div></div></div></footer><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/webpack-37f8c22e297b04f8.js\" async=\"\"></script><script>(self.__next_f=self.__next_f||[]).push([0]);self.__next_f.push([2,null])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"1:HL[\\\"/_next/static/css/c70a6d8e0709b465.css\\\",\\\"style\\\"]\\n2:HL[\\\"/_next/static/css/7eb325243a3b1d61.css\\\",\\\"style\\\"]\\n\"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"3:I[2846,[],\\\"\\\"]\\n5:I[6481,[\\\"3433\\\",\\\"static/chunks/3433-9ddc6f7f78d9421c.js\\\",\\\"4194\\\",\\\"static/chunks/4194-e847e413fe1b63d3.js\\\",\\\"4754\\\",\\\"static/chunks/app/tools/nahwu-shorof/page-aeb97ee1a9ed6df1.js\\\"],\\\"default\\\"]\\n6:I[1693,[\\\"3433\\\",\\\"static/chunks/3433-9ddc6f7f78d9421c.js\\\",\\\"4194\\\",\\\"static/chunks/4194-e847e413fe1b63d3.js\\\",\\\"4754\\\",\\\"static/chunks/app/tools/nahwu-shorof/page-aeb97ee1a9ed6df1.js\\\"],\\\"default\\\"]\\n7:I[4707,[],\\\"\\\"]\\n8:I[6423,[],\\\"\\\"]\\n9:I[8003,[\\\"3433\\\",\\\"static/chunks/3433-9ddc6f7f78d9421c.js\\\",\\\"2972\\\",\\\"static/chunks/2972-8ce94bd856f9372b.js\\\",\\\"3185\\\",\\\"static/chunks/app/layout-c819fc26cf8b0e32.js\\\"],\\\"\\\"]\\na:I[9314,[\\\"3433\\\",\\\"static/chunks/3433-9ddc6f7f78d9421c.js\\\",\\\"2972\\\",\\\"static/chunks/2972-